{
  "_comment": [
    "The shape of the Help Centre, separate from its words.",
    "",
    "slug        stable id. It is the /help anchor, the HelpTip key and the",
    "            UNIQUE (slug, locale) half that makes a translation a",
    "            translation rather than a second article.",
    "category    groups the article on /help. Must be one of CATEGORIES.",
    "order       within the category, ascending. Gaps of 10 on purpose, so a",
    "            new article can be slotted between two without renumbering.",
    "href        where the reader goes to DO the thing. NOT in the database:",
    "            a route is code, not content, it is identical in every",
    "            language, and storing it 134 times invites 134 chances to",
    "            drift. help-links.test.mjs asserts every one resolves to a",
    "            real page.tsx in this repo.",
    "core        true = translated into all ten languages. The other 17 are",
    "            English + Greek, and every other locale falls back to",
    "            English with a visible marker."
  ],
